(DOCUMIND DEMONSTRATION HANDBOOK) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The DocuMind Learning Centre offers two training plans, in this order: Foundation and Advanced.) Tj T*
(The Foundation plan costs NPR 3000 per month. It includes two instructor-led workshops each) Tj T*
(month and access to the beginner exercise library. Foundation is intended for first-time Python) Tj T*
(learners.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The second plan, Advanced, costs NPR 7500 per month. Advanced includes six instructor-led) Tj T*
(workshops each month, one individual mentoring session, and access to the advanced exercise) Tj T*
(library. Learners should complete the Foundation course or pass a placement assessment before) Tj T*
(joining Advanced.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Both plans include email support. The support desk operates Monday through Friday from 09:00 to) Tj T*
(17:00 Nepal time. Support requests are answered within two business days. There is no weekend) Tj T*
(support desk service.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The learning centre is located in Lalitpur, Nepal. In-person workshops take place in Room 204.) Tj T*
(Online workshops use a meeting link sent the day before the workshop. Learners should bring a) Tj T*
(laptop with Python 3.11 or newer installed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Interview preparation sessions last 45 minutes and cover Python fundamentals, SQL queries, and) Tj T*
(API design. A learner can request an interview preparation booking by providing a name, email) Tj T*
(address, future date, and time. A booking is reserved only after the learner confirms the) Tj T*
(complete summary.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Refund requests must be submitted within seven calendar days of the initial payment. A refund) Tj T*
(is available only when the learner has attended no workshops. Submit a refund request by) Tj T*
(emailing support@documind.example with the payment receipt number. This handbook does not state) Tj T*
(any scholarship or accommodation policy.) Tj T*
ET
